  "text_md": "# ◊ = Planning committee members\n\n# DISCLOSURES\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Speaker</th>\n    <th>Details</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Chappell, Kathy</td>\n    <td>am a member of an advisory board for Pfizer and Merck. receive no honoraria: Travel costs are reimbursed to</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Gordon, Jennifer</td>\n    <td>am a member of a global educational advisory board for Pfizer and Merck-Sorono.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Grad, Roland</td>\n    <td>received honoraria from the International Centre for Evidence Based Medicine for two online modules.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Lalla, Leonora</td>\n    <td>have received dividends as a minor shareholder in a medical clinic in Pierrefonds, Quebec.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Outschoorn; Amy</td>\n    <td>have received compensation from industry for travel expenses only; for sitting on a board of directors for Food Allergy Canada and the Canadian Premature Babies Foundation.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Smith, Karen</td>\n    <td>have received or will be receiving a grant or honorarium from Shire Pharmaceuticals for contributing to an investigator initiated research grant. The Queen's CPD department has received payment from commercial organizations in support of programming: Ido not receive personal support or gifts:</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Sockalingam; Sanjeev</td>\n    <td>receiving a grant or honorarium from Shire Pharmaceuticals for initiated research grant.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>Switzer; Connie</td>\n    <td>board for Abbvie and Merck.</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n\n# NOTHING TO DECLARE\n\nArchibald, Doug\n\nBlack, Jessica ◊\n\nBrien, Susan\n\nCampbell, Craig\n\nChmelicek, John ◊\n\nDaniel, Sam\n\nDavis, Dave\n\nFleming, Michael ◊\n\nGalioto, Riccarda ◊\n\nHarvey, Janice ◊\n\nLawrence, Susanne\n\nLeblanc, Connie ◊\n\nMatlow, Anne\n\nMazurek, Karen ◊\n\nMeuser, Jamie\n\nNewton, Christie ◊\n\nParson, Bob ◊\n\nRipley, Cheryl ◊\n\nSargeant, Joan\n\nSisler, Jeff