      "text": "Speaker Details Chappell, Kathy am a member of an advisory board for Pfizer and Merck. receive no honoraria: Travel costs are reimbursed to Gordon, Jennifer am a member of a global educational advisory board for Pfizer and Merck-Sorono. Grad, Roland received honoraria from the International Centre for Evidence Based Medicine for two online modules. Lalla, Leonora have received dividends as a minor shareholder in a medical clinic in Pierrefonds, Quebec. Outschoorn; Amy have received compensation from industry for travel expenses only; for sitting on a board of directors for Food Allergy Canada and the Canadian Premature Babies Foundation. Smith, Karen have received or will be receiving a grant or honorarium from Shire Pharmaceuticals for contributing to an investigator initiated research grant. The Queen's CPD department has received payment from commercial organizations in support of programming: Ido not receive personal support or gifts: Sockalingam; Sanjeev receiving a grant or honorarium from Shire Pharmaceuticals for initiated research grant. Switzer; Connie board for Abbvie and Merck.",
